    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Only Rule of War: Defend Your Territory!</strong></h2>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a turn-based strategy shooting game</strong> where each turn lasts only a few seconds, offering fast-paced and intense tactical battles! On this battlefield, numbers equal power\u2014build strong units, capture territories, and victory will be within your grasp!</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precisely calculate your unit\u2019s movement, rotation, and collisions to land them in buff zones. <strong>At the end of each turn, all units' buffs and damage effects are applied</strong>. Can you seize advantageous positions and trap your opponents? Your success depends on strategy, courage, and a little bit of luck!</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473780/extras/754f72da93cfeffa051c26e4f341f957.poster.avif?t=1745344298\" width=630 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473780/extras/754f72da93cfeffa051c26e4f341f957.webm?t=1745344298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473780/extras/754f72da93cfeffa051c26e4f341f957.mp4?t=1745344298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategy and Timing Are Everything</strong></h2>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the entire battlefield\u2014grow your army while preventing your opponents from getting stronger! Every shot matters, and <strong>by mastering physics-based angles and rebounds, even a hopeless situation can turn into a game-changing move!</strong></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473780/extras/dfbb7e670dd715a0fe93701bd76e175a.avif?t=1745344298\" width=692 height=674 /></span></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473780/extras/9d36eb983112fb82f6fbb43277c7df19.poster.avif?t=1745344298\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473780/extras/9d36eb983112fb82f6fbb43277c7df19.webm?t=1745344298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473780/extras/9d36eb983112fb82f6fbb43277c7df19.mp4?t=1745344298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2>  <br>\u2705 **Fast-Paced Matches, Instant Action** \ud83c\udfaf  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match lasts around 10 minutes\u2014jump in anytime for a quick game or an intense challenge!</p>  <br><br>\u2705 **Easy to Play, Deep in Strategy** \ud83d\uddb1  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your shots with just the mouse! While the mechanics are simple, true mastery requires careful planning and strategic execution. Complete time and turn challenges to make later stages easier!</p>  <br><br>\u2705 **Unlimited Retries, Refine Your Tactics** \ud83d\udd04  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No limits! Whether you're optimizing the fastest clear path or trying extreme counterplays, you can retry as many times as needed to perfect your strategy!</p>  <br><br>\u2705 **100 Unique Stages, Endless Challenges** \ud83c\udfae  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features **50 main stages + 50 advanced stages**, providing 100 unique battlefields filled with endless tactical possibilities!</p>  <br><br>\u2705 **Hidden Achievements Await!** \ud83c\udfc6  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock secret achievements as you play\u2014can you discover them all?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Only Rule of War: Defend Your Territory!</strong></h2>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a turn-based strategy shooting game</strong> where each turn lasts only a few seconds, offering fast-paced and intense tactical battles! On this battlefield, numbers equal power\u2014build strong units, capture territories, and victory will be within your grasp!</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precisely calculate your unit\u2019s movement, rotation, and collisions to land them in buff zones. <strong>At the end of each turn, all units' buffs and damage effects are applied</strong>. Can you seize advantageous positions and trap your opponents? Your success depends on strategy, courage, and a little bit of luck!</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473780/extras/754f72da93cfeffa051c26e4f341f957.poster.avif?t=1745344298\" width=630 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473780/extras/754f72da93cfeffa051c26e4f341f957.webm?t=1745344298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473780/extras/754f72da93cfeffa051c26e4f341f957.mp4?t=1745344298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategy and Timing Are Everything</strong></h2>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the entire battlefield\u2014grow your army while preventing your opponents from getting stronger! Every shot matters, and <strong>by mastering physics-based angles and rebounds, even a hopeless situation can turn into a game-changing move!</strong></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473780/extras/dfbb7e670dd715a0fe93701bd76e175a.avif?t=1745344298\" width=692 height=674 /></span></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473780/extras/9d36eb983112fb82f6fbb43277c7df19.poster.avif?t=1745344298\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473780/extras/9d36eb983112fb82f6fbb43277c7df19.webm?t=1745344298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473780/extras/9d36eb983112fb82f6fbb43277c7df19.mp4?t=1745344298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2>  <br>\u2705 **Fast-Paced Matches, Instant Action** \ud83c\udfaf  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match lasts around 10 minutes\u2014jump in anytime for a quick game or an intense challenge!</p>  <br><br>\u2705 **Easy to Play, Deep in Strategy** \ud83d\uddb1  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your shots with just the mouse! While the mechanics are simple, true mastery requires careful planning and strategic execution. Complete time and turn challenges to make later stages easier!</p>  <br><br>\u2705 **Unlimited Retries, Refine Your Tactics** \ud83d\udd04  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No limits! Whether you're optimizing the fastest clear path or trying extreme counterplays, you can retry as many times as needed to perfect your strategy!</p>  <br><br>\u2705 **100 Unique Stages, Endless Challenges** \ud83c\udfae  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features **50 main stages + 50 advanced stages**, providing 100 unique battlefields filled with endless tactical possibilities!</p>  <br><br>\u2705 **Hidden Achievements Await!** \ud83c\udfc6  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock secret achievements as you play\u2014can you discover them all?</p>",
